Comment: 5,0:02:11.66,0:02:16.37,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k0}{\k471}演奏未來  正如你願
Comment: 5,0:02:16.37,0:02:21.12,OPCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\k0}{\k475}盡情讚頌  獲得經驗
